  ],
  "reason": "The reviewer correctly identified that the original text overstated the nature of the evidence from P0388 by claiming 'strict causal verification' (严格的因果验证) and implying a natural neoantigen setting. The selected evidence for P0388 explicitly states it is an 'engineered tumor model expressing SFB antigen fragments' (synthetic neoantigen mimicry) and cautions that this simplifies real TME complexity. The edit replaces 'functional complementation experiments' with 'synthetic antigen mimicry experiments' and removes 'strict', accurately reflecting the empirical study's methodology while preserving the valid mechanistic details (SFB, TH17 plasticity, Hh negative control) supported by the evidence."
